@convince_wp_fail
on-arrival: wp_relation -= 3
go-to: endorsements

Unfortunately, the WP has refused to support [+ dvp_candidate +] for the presidency.


@convince_cnblp
view-if: cnblp_formed and cnblp_candidate != dvp_candidate and dvp_candidate != "Braun"
go-to: convince_cnblp_success if cnblp_relation >= 50; convince_cnblp_fail if cnblp_relation < 50
max-visits: 1

