@convince_dnvp
view-if: dnvp_candidate != dvp_candidate and dnvp_left >= 0 and dvp_candidate != "Braun" and dnvp_exist
choose-if: dvp_votes > dnvp_votes or (dvp_candidate != "Luther" and dvp_candidate != "Eckener")
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ dnvp_name +] is not satisfied with our candidate selection. They enjoy more popular support than we do.
go-to: convince_dnvp_success if dnvp_relation >= 50; convince_dnvp_fail if dnvp_relation < 50
max-visits: 1

